{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_shaco_backstab": {
        "attack": "【附加包】匕首刺击。被动 <#ff9028ff>背刺<>：从背后攻击敌方英雄时额外造成<#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。<#ff9028ff>双面毒刃<>：每<#ffb900ff>8秒<>下一次普攻改为掷出毒刃，造成<#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% 法强<>的<#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>并<#ef5350ff>减速30%<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_shaco_backstab": {
        "attack": "【附加包】匕首刺擊。被動 <#ff9028ff>背刺<>：從背後攻擊敵方英雄時額外造成<#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% 攻擊力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>。<#ff9028ff>雙面毒刃<>：每<#ffb900ff>8秒<>下一次普攻改為擲出毒刃，造成<#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% 法術強度<>的<#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>並<#ef5350ff>緩速30%<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_shaco_backstab": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] Dagger stabs. Passive <#ff9028ff>Backstab<>: attacks on enemy champions from behind deal <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% AD<> bonus <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Two-Shiv Poison<>: every <#ffb900ff>8s<> his next attack throws a shiv instead, dealing <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> by 30%."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_shaco_backstab": {
        "attack": "[확장] 단검으로 찌릅니다. 기본 지속 효과 <#ff9028ff>암습<>: 적 챔피언을 뒤에서 공격하면 <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 25%<> 추가 <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>. <#ff9028ff>양날 독<>: <#ffb900ff>8초<>마다 다음 기본 공격 대신 독 단검을 던져 <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 70%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>를 입히고 <#ef5350ff>30% 둔화<>시킵니다."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_shaco_backstab": {
        "attack": "【拡張】短剣で刺す。パッシブ <#ff9028ff>バックスタブ<>：敵チャンピオンの背後からの攻撃は<#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の25%<>の追加<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>。<#ff9028ff>ポイズンダガー<>：<#ffb900ff>8秒<>ごとに次の通常攻撃で短剣を投げ、<#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>魔力の70%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>と<#ef5350ff>30%スロウ<>。"
      }
    }
  }
}
